# Otter Shell — environment
#
# The AI hunt generator (Generate Hunt / Report→hunt / Intel→hunt) and the CISA KEV
# model-fallback call the Anthropic Messages API. They are OFF unless this is set.
#
# Point it at a backend that holds your ANTHROPIC_API_KEY server-side. A reference
# FastAPI proxy ships in migration/proxy_starter.py; the contract it implements is in
# migration/03_PROXY_CONTRACT.md.
#
# Never put an API key in this file or anywhere else in the frontend — Vite inlines
# every VITE_* value into the public bundle, so a key here is a published key.
#
# VITE_CLAUDE_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/claude

# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and uncomment the line above.
